window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Obsessed Fox is a small town romantic suspense with a hilarious silver fox hero and a woman living a fake life.<br> <br> One act of self defense and one set of fingerprints was about to ruin everything I worked so hard for.<br> <br> I was a murderer. A woman on the run living under a false name. Willow Creek was supposed to be the perfect place to hide out. A town with the lowest crime rate in the country. Until it wasn’t. Now the Sheriff had my fingerprints and the name I gave them wouldn’t match the one they found. It was time to move on. Unfortunately, Hendrix didn’t agree with me.<br> <br> There is such a thing as happily ever after. Or so they say. I got one night with the woman who now has me obsessed, but at the stroke of midnight, she disappeared. Unlike the fairytale, I know exactly where to find Maisie but she refuses to give me the time of day. Now she wants to run away and take my heart with her.<br> <br> I can’t let that happen.<br> <br> Can I prove to her that she can have everything she wants or like the first time, is she going to disappear before the clock tower finishes ringing?</p>"; 
